Key Limitations Across All Editions
• Minimum Capacity: All reservations and increments must be at least 50 slots.
• Scaling Metering: Autoscaled slots are billed for a minimum of one minute whenever a scale-up event occurs.
• Regional Scope: Commitments and reservations are regional resources and cannot be shared or moved across different regions or multi-regions.
• Idle Slot Sharing: Idle slots can only be shared between reservations of the same edition and within the same administration project.
• Billing Exclusions: Edition pricing applies to query compute but does not cover storage, BI Engine GiB-hour charges, or streaming insert fees
